    <string name="mayonaka_provisioning_title">Provision &TERMUX_APP_NAME;?</string>
    <string name="mayonaka_provisioning_message">Run the first-run setup script now?\n\nIt installs the package set (fish, starship, fastfetch, git, tmux, ripgrep…), writes the themed shell, prompt, tmux and fastfetch configs, scaffolds ~/.shortcuts, and patches the termux-api helper.\n\nIt needs a network connection and takes a few minutes. You can run it later with <tt>bash ~/setup.sh</tt> or from Settings → &TERMUX_APP_NAME;.</string>
